  "details": "- CVE-2026-123007: account for queued HTTP/2 frames when validating\n  WINDOW_UPDATE to prevent connection flow control window overflow\n- CVE-2026-113425: fix mail proxy use-after-free; block client writes\n  while waiting for auth_http, connecting upstream or resolving SMTP client\n- CVE-2026-118899: fix endless loop while reading the request body over\n  SSL by handling NGX_AGAIN explicitly\n- CVE-2026-123634: fix resolver use-after-free when a non-current resolve\n  is finalized from a resolve handler; report CNAME restart failures\n- CVE-2026-123633: fix HTTP/2 use-after-free by resetting the reusable\n  connection status on stream creation\n- CVE-2026-125283: fix buffer overflow in try_files with alias by\n  recalculating the uri length after script evaluation\n- CVE-2026-123640: reject ClientHello with duplicate SNI or ALPN or\n  trailing extension data in ngx_stream_ssl_preread_module",
